# the Mach-O format and its registration
#
# the exact revision of each specification the Mach-O modules implement, so
# a change to any of them is a visible version bump. every header is the one
# the stated SDK ships, read at the open source tag it is published under.
# mink's Mach-O sources are written from these layouts and vendor none of them.
# a thin file is a model beside the input it was read from, so a fileset's
# members, the images its entries name, are cut from that input.

